=94 it currently has the same wrong phrasing.</p>
<p dir=3D"ltr"><strong>What's genuinely still missing to finish this repo</=
strong> (this report gives methodology and results, not the underlying file=
s):</p>
<ol dir=3D"ltr">
<li><strong>AutoDock Vina files</strong> =E2=80=94 the docking configs, the=
 78-compound ligand library (SDF/PDBQT), and the results workbook mentioned=
 in section 4.4.4</li>
<li><strong>GROMACS input files</strong> =E2=80=94 the .mdp parameter files=
, topology files, and the "HPC-ready packages" for Nebivolol/Dantrolene/Ari=
piprazole mentioned in the deliverables list</li>
<li><strong>RFdiffusion/ProteinMPNN outputs</strong> =E2=80=94 the 100 gene=
rated backbones, the ProteinMPNN sequences, the AlphaFold/ColabFold predict=
ion files for Design 28 and Design 86</li>
<li><strong>Analysis scripts</strong> =E2=80=94 whatever produced the RMSD/=
RMSF/contact/H-bond plots (Figures 5.1=E2=80=935.12) =E2=80=94 likely Pytho=
n with MDAnalysis or GROMACS' own <code>gmx rms</code>/<code>gmx rmsf</code=
> tools</li>
<li><strong>The poster and presentation slides</strong> from CSRP 2026, if =
you have them saved</li>
<li><strong>The full PDF report itself</strong> =E2=80=94 worth including i=
n <code>report/</code> even though it's already summarized in the README</l=
i>
</ol>
<p dir=3D"ltr">If you have any of these saved locally, upload them and I'll=
